*>   1998-10-06 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 675
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB FEENIGHT STEP070
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FEE0024.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    COPY FEE0024C.
01 OUT-RECORD.
    *> FEE WAIVER INDICATOR
    05 FEE-WAIVER-FLG     PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    *> MONTHLY SERVICE FEE
    05 SVC-CHARGE         PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM FEE-CONCESSION
    DISPLAY "FEE-WAIVER-FLG=" FEE-WAIVER-FLG
    DISPLAY "SVC-CHARGE=" SVC-CHARGE
    STOP RUN.
FEE-CONCESSION.
    *> STUDENT FEE WAIVER
    IF STUDENT-FLAG = 'Y' AND CUSTOMER-AGE < 24
        MOVE 'Y' TO FEE-WAIVER-FLG
        MOVE 0.00 TO SVC-CHARGE
    *> SENIOR FEE WAIVER
    ELSE IF CUSTOMER-AGE >= 60
        MOVE 'Y' TO FEE-WAIVER-FLG
        MOVE 0.00 TO SVC-CHARGE
    ELSE
        MOVE 4.00 TO SVC-CHARGE
    END-IF
    END-IF.
